  "description": "A form of prejudice, discrimination, or hostility directed against Muslims. The meme relies on this stereotype by implying that Muslims are either insensitive (top panel) or overly emotional (bottom panel) about a mass shooting that occurred at mosques, thereby portraying them as inherently incapable of appropriate emotional response or as being complicit in the violence. This is a core component of the meme's hateful intent.",
